# ajkurig default instrument kit and adaptive layers.
# ComposeSong reads the instruments, pans, layers, tempoboost and intensity of a
# template; its patterns are ignored. Copy this file into a game to start a song.
#
# Cell: NOTE INSTRUMENT EFFECT   e.g.  C-4 05 037
#   NOTE        C-4, C#4 ... B-9   --- = nothing   === = note off
#   INSTRUMENT  two digits (01..31)   .. = keep
#   EFFECT      0xy arpeggio (+x, +y semitones)   Cxx volume (hex 00..40)   ... = none
#
# Channel roles used by the composer and the arranger:
#   1 drums  2 bass  3 hihat  4 chords  5 lead  6-8 tension voices  9 bells  10 pulse
#   11 shaker  12 clap  13 pad  14 pluck  15 offbeat  16 harmony (11-16 written by the arranger)
#
# Adaptive layers: a channel is heard while its signal reaches the threshold.
# Signal names are free: the game sets them by name on the audio engine.

title Template
tempo 125
tempoboost 18
speed 6
pan 0.5 0.5 0.68 0.34 0.63 0.5 0.5 0.5 0.3 0.7 0.74 0.44 0.5 0.36 0.62 0.4
intensity action tension danger

instrument 1  kick     sine      attack 0.001 decay 0.16 volume 1.0 slide -7
instrument 2  snare    noise     attack 0.001 decay 0.12 volume 0.5 filter 0.2
instrument 3  hihat    noise     attack 0.001 decay 0.035 volume 0.2 filter 0.05
instrument 4  bass     saw       attack 0.004 decay 0.18 sustain 0.55 release 0.05 volume 0.45 filter 0.8 sub 0.6 drive 0.8
instrument 5  chords   square    attack 0.004 decay 0.25 sustain 0.5 release 0.08 volume 0.14 duty 0.25
instrument 6  lead     square    attack 0.01 decay 0.2 sustain 0.7 release 0.12 volume 0.18 duty 0.5
instrument 7  stab     saw       attack 0.002 decay 0.3 volume 0.42 filter 0.38 slide -0.3 sub 0.7 detune 0.1
instrument 8  growl    square    attack 0.03 decay 0.4 sustain 0.65 release 0.25 volume 0.4 duty 0.3 filter 0.6 sub 0.8 detune 0.08
instrument 9  drone    saw       attack 0.08 decay 0.5 sustain 0.85 release 0.35 volume 0.46 filter 0.74 sub 0.9 detune 0.15
instrument 10 bell     triangle  attack 0.001 decay 0.18 volume 0.2
instrument 11 pulse    square    attack 0.002 decay 0.1 volume 0.14 duty 0.125
instrument 12 shaker   noise     attack 0.001 decay 0.025 volume 0.11 filter 0.02
instrument 13 clap     noise     attack 0.002 decay 0.09 volume 0.26 filter 0.35
instrument 14 pad      saw       attack 0.35 decay 0.6 sustain 0.8 release 0.6 volume 0.075 filter 0.88 detune 0.12
instrument 15 pluck    square    attack 0.001 decay 0.11 volume 0.085 duty 0.25 filter 0.4
instrument 16 offbeat  square    attack 0.002 decay 0.07 volume 0.08 duty 0.5 filter 0.5
instrument 17 harmony  triangle  attack 0.01 decay 0.2 sustain 0.6 release 0.12 volume 0.11

#     channel  signal     threshold
layer 1        always     0
layer 2        always     0
layer 3        action     0.15
layer 4        action     0.35
layer 5        action     0.6
layer 6        tension    1
layer 7        tension    2
layer 8        tension    3
layer 9        combo      0.3
layer 10       danger     0.5
layer 11       always     0
layer 12       action     0.2
layer 13       always     0
layer 14       action     0.3
layer 15       action     0.5
layer 16       action     0.7

order 0

pattern 0
C-3 01 ... | D-2 04 ... | C-9 03 C30 | D-4 05 037 | A-5 06 ... | D-2 07 ... | A-1 08 ... | D-1 09 ... | D-6 10 ... | D-3 11 C40
